  "title": "Tronox Declares Third Quarter 2026 Dividend",
  "summary": "STAMFORD, Conn., July 29, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Tronox Holdings plc (NYSE:TROX), the world’s leading integrated manufacturer of titanium dioxide pigment, announced today that its Board of Directors declared a quarterly dividend of $0.05 per share. The dividend is payable on October 9, 2026 to shareholders of record at the close of business on August 10, 2026. … Continue reading \"Tronox Declares Third Quarter 2026 Dividend\"",
